= S4.1 Intended use

This work is a support-audited methods pilot. It does not provide a diagnostic test, individual prediction, treatment recommendation, or validated biomarker.

= S4.2 Interpretation

MNPS and diffusion summaries are research measurements whose interpretation depends on coordinate, temporal-support, and validity contracts. Q/W_Q is a recording-level proxy. Destination, resilience, DF-DRIFT-C1, and method-limited 9D `v_norm` outputs cannot be promoted to clinical evidence without separate validation.

= S4.3 Future work

A later clinical study would require independently designed cohorts, prespecified participant-level endpoints, longitudinal or intervention validation where relevant, and external replication.

